     "description": "In a nail-biter against the Vancouver Canucks on home ice, Pierre-Luc Dubois delivers the game-winning heroics in the final minute of overtime. With teammate Aliaksei Protas drawing the attention of the Vancouver defense skating behind the net, Dubois slips into the high slot undetected. Receiving a perfectly timed pass, he glides closer to the crease, executes a smooth deke, and snaps the puck past the goaltender for his second goal of the night, sealing the thrilling victory.\n\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
